1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,649
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,691 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,359
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,401 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,929
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,971 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,309
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,351 --> 00:00:29,839
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,881 --> 00:00:31,329
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,371 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,179
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,221 --> 00:00:36,789
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:38,239
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,281 --> 00:00:42,439
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,350
For the next few days,

17
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:49,520
stay in your room and recover.

18
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:51,640
In your spare time,

19
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:53,470
focus on preparing

20
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:57,280
to show Young Master Rong around.

21
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,070
Don't worry, Father.

22
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,750
We'll close this deal with the Rongs.

23
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:03,430
I hope so.

24
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,400
Well...

25
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:06,760
you should head back.

26
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:09,000
Jingchen and I have things to discuss.

27
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:10,590
All right.

28
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:21,179
Who would've thought

29
00:01:21,221 --> 00:01:24,400
that girl would take a blade for me?

30
00:01:24,870 --> 00:01:26,040
Jingchen.

31
00:01:26,790 --> 00:01:28,489
Times like this

32
00:01:28,531 --> 00:01:30,510
show you who's loyal and who's not.

33
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:35,400
As your biological daughter,

34
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,920
taking a blade for her father

35
00:01:37,590 --> 00:01:39,310
is simply her duty.

36
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,310
Exactly.

37
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:43,920
When it comes to children,

38
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:46,840
nothing beats your own flesh and blood.

39
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:49,760
Had I been there,

40
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:52,920
I'd have taken the hit for you
without hesitation.

41
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:56,070
I'm not talking about you.

42
00:01:56,400 --> 00:02:00,350
I mean that ungrateful dog
I had thrown into the river.

43
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:02,640
Never mind that.

44
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:06,000
Young Master Rong is setting out, right?

45
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,070
Yes.

46
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:08,960
Everything is ready for his arrival.

47
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,430
The hotel is all set too.

48
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:14,190
I know I can count on you.

49
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:16,980
=Episode 16=

50
00:02:28,910 --> 00:02:29,779
Ms. Lu.

51
00:02:29,821 --> 00:02:32,080
You need plenty of nourishment
to recover.

52
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,030
I made this bird's nest soup myself

53
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,960
to help you regain your strength.

54
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,080
I was just getting thirsty.

55
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:40,240
Thanks, Lady Que.

56
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:49,009
I never thought Lady Feng

57
00:02:49,051 --> 00:02:50,680
would meet such an end.

58
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:52,840
You even said

59
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:56,120
you didn't want anyone else dying here.

60
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,430
Did I?

61
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,169
What I remember saying was,

62
00:03:02,211 --> 00:03:04,470
I'd spare her if she knew her place.

63
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:08,190
But anyone who threatens Father

64
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,560
deserves to die.

65
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,840
No matter how many die, so be it.

66
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:17,080
(Good thing I saw how ruthless she was)

67
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,120
(and backed down early.)

68
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:23,590
You're quite a shot, Ms. Lu.

69
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,240
I heard your shot hit a vital spot.

70
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:35,000
Of course.

71
00:03:35,630 --> 00:03:37,569
I've trained with guns for so long

72
00:03:37,611 --> 00:03:39,870
but I've never shot a real person.

73
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:44,449
Lady Que, you have no idea.

74
00:03:44,491 --> 00:03:45,520
What a thrill.

75
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:49,310
It just wasn't quite enough.

76
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:54,000
You've finished the bird's nest soup.

77
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,590
Then I'll leave you to recover.

78
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,400
You're not bothering me.

79
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:01,400
Lady Que, stay and chat with me
a little longer, okay?

80
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,840
I need to take the governor some too.

81
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:17,849
The Lu Chamber of Commerce handles
grain, textiles, tea, and coal,

82
00:04:17,891 --> 00:04:20,430
plus theaters, pawnshops,
casinos, and docks.

83
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,809
In Fancheng proper alone,

84
00:04:21,851 --> 00:04:24,219
annual revenue reaches
four million taels of silver.

85
00:04:24,261 --> 00:04:27,579
Plus businesses and river merchants
in the surrounding towns...

86
00:04:27,621 --> 00:04:29,310
Ms. Lu,
you're really putting in the effort.

87
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:35,190
I learned from you, Commander He.

88
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,979
All you know is

89
00:04:43,021 --> 00:04:45,680
Iron Leopard wants a deal with
the Rong Clan of Lancheng.

90
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:49,630
Do you even know
what they're dealing in?

91
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:53,270
Yet you're wasting your time on this.

92
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,430
What do you mean?

93
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,390
Nothing.

94
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,360
Just thought I'd warn you.

95
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,480
Don't waste your energy.

96
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:03,600
This deal won't happen.

97
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,600
(He's always like this.)

98
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,310
(He never explains anything clearly.)

99
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,160
(Big deal.)

100
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:21,270
(I'll figure it out myself.)

101
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:42,020
(Rong Muxian)

102
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,360
Young Master Rong.

103
00:05:43,830 --> 00:05:44,630
Please.

104
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,000
This way, please.

105
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:52,800
(They're taking this so seriously.)

106
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,920
(What deal are they negotiating?)

107
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:10,950
Come in.

108
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,929
Excuse me.

109
00:06:16,971 --> 00:06:18,070
I've brought tea for our guest.

110
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:19,240
Thank you.

111
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,310
Anything else?

112
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:33,680
Would you care for some refreshments?

113
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:35,409
Thank you.

114
00:06:35,451 --> 00:06:36,390
I'm not hungry right now.

115
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:38,430
Just leave the tea and go.

116
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,040
Yes.

117
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:57,000
Why is everyone being so secretive?

118
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,979
(Staff Officer Chen, handle matters
at camp these next few days.)

119
00:07:02,021 --> 00:07:02,899
(Oh, no.)

120
00:07:02,941 --> 00:07:04,000
Why is he coming back?

121
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:43,070
Rong Yunhai has planted ten thousand mu
of poppy fields deep in the mountains.

122
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,920
He's ruined countless families.

123
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,750
His precious son is right here.

124
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,659
Why spare him?

125
00:07:48,701 --> 00:07:49,480
(Poppies.)

126
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:50,714
(Kill Rong Muxian.)

127
00:07:50,756 --> 00:07:52,480
Killing Rong Muxian isn't our best move.

128
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:58,240
I know you're right.

129
00:07:58,430 --> 00:08:00,920
Iron Leopard is sparing no expense

130
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,560
to buy opium from the Rongs.

131
00:08:03,390 --> 00:08:04,870
He'll have to use the gold bars.

132
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:07,750
Once the treasure map surfaces,

133
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,870
we'll have our chance.

134
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,870
That's not the best move either.

135
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:14,929
This won't work.

136
00:08:14,971 --> 00:08:15,830
Neither will that.

137
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,000
Then what's our best move?

138
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:24,950
(So Lu Zhentian is buying opium
from the Rongs.)

139
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:28,480
The Rongs are cautious with clients.

140
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:31,049
If we stand by and let them

141
00:08:31,091 --> 00:08:32,080
seal the deal,

142
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,550
but fail to intercept the treasure map,

143
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,390
once opium enters Fancheng,

144
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:40,080
the people will be the ones who suffer.

145
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:42,120
So we do nothing?

146
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,360
At least we can't kill Rong Muxian.

147
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:48,510
His father planted those poppy fields.

148
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,270
If anyone should die, it isn't him.

149
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,790
Here's what we'll do.

150
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:58,480
Have our men pose as bandits.

151
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,600
Kidnap Rong Muxian.

152
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:01,840
Once he disappears,

153
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,870
Iron Leopard will try to cover it up.

154
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,320
Then have someone spread the word.

155
00:09:08,630 --> 00:09:09,960
Once Rong Yunhai hears,

156
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,440
the deal will be off for now.

157
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:12,960
Then we'll figure out our next move.

158
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,360
If the deal falls through,

159
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,120
the treasure map won't surface.

160
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:21,459
The army should've upgraded
its gear long ago.

161
00:09:21,501 --> 00:09:23,790
Iron Leopard and that brat Lu Shaoyun

162
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,630
have squandered military funds
for the past two years.

163
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:28,550
Then there are the other greedy men,

164
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:31,600
especially those two crooks,
Yang and Qin.

165
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:34,120
They're Iron Leopard's distant nephews,

166
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,320
and they've been getting fat off it.

167
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:40,840
At this rate,

168
00:09:41,910 --> 00:09:44,600
the Lu Army will become hopelessly weak.

169
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:45,750
It'll fold at the first attack.

170
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:49,120
How could it protect Fancheng's people?

171
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,630
But what if

172
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:58,510
everyone in Fancheng becomes
an opium addict?

173
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:02,790
What good would a powerful Lu Army be?

174
00:10:03,670 --> 00:10:05,750
To protect a city of the living dead?

175
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:09,179
Make the arrangements quickly.

176
00:10:09,221 --> 00:10:10,099
Tomorrow,

177
00:10:10,141 --> 00:10:12,219
that girl is taking Rong Muxian

178
00:10:12,261 --> 00:10:15,600
to the pawnshop, casino, and granary.

179
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:18,750
Do it at the granary.

180
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,510
(Protect...)

181
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,320
(the people of Fancheng?)

182
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,240
Commander He.

183
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:42,240
Young Master Rong should be well rested.

184
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,720
Let's go.

185
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,910
Candied hawthorn!

186
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,080
I want this one.

187
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,649
Miss.

188
00:11:21,691 --> 00:11:23,129
Sweet-and-tart candied hawthorn!

189
00:11:23,171 --> 00:11:23,960
Have one.

190
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:24,939
Sure.

191
00:11:24,981 --> 00:11:25,670
One, please.

192
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,750
Here.

193
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:30,550
One skewer doesn't cost this much.

194
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,270
I'll take the whole lot.

195
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:35,600
Here.

196
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,870
You're in for a treat today.

197
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:40,240
I'm in a good mood.

198
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:40,960
Come on.

199
00:11:41,390 --> 00:11:43,600
Why are you so happy?

200
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,270
Because...

201
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:46,910
Because he's a good man.

202
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:48,390
Here.

203
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,840
One for you too.

204
00:11:50,630 --> 00:11:51,790
One for everyone.

205
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,000
Here's another one.

206
00:11:56,910 --> 00:11:58,440
I want one too.

207
00:11:58,870 --> 00:11:59,510
Here you go.

208
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:03,000
Thank you!

209
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,670
Thank you!

210
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:07,750
Fancheng's young ladies are
beautiful and generous.

211
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,960
And so full of life.

212
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:13,030
Unlike back in Lancheng.

213
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:16,480
(That's because opium has ravaged
the people of Lancheng.)

214
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,120
Ms. Lu.

215
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:22,870
This is our new army doctor, Dr. Hu.

216
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,390
The governor asked him to give everyone
a routine pulse check.

217
00:12:25,630 --> 00:12:27,369
He just finished examining
the Fourteenth Concubine

218
00:12:27,411 --> 00:12:28,720
when I saw you come back.

219
00:12:29,910 --> 00:12:30,720
Go ahead.

220
00:12:55,510 --> 00:12:57,240
Governor, you're in excellent health.

221
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,339
Just take my medicine on schedule,

222
00:12:59,381 --> 00:13:01,240
and it should help you live longer.

223
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:05,150
It's been quite a while.

224
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,270
Why isn't the Fourteenth Concubine
pregnant yet?

225
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:09,840
Judging from her pulse,

226
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,790
she may not conceive easily.

227
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:12,790
What do you mean?

228
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:13,960
Forgive me, Governor.

229
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:16,099
I'm only reporting what I found.

230
00:13:16,141 --> 00:13:17,270
However...

231
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:18,320
Go on.

232
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:20,870
When I gave Ms. Lu
a routine pulse check,

233
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:23,670
I found that Ms. Lu
is very likely to conceive.

234
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:26,240
If she chooses a husband soon

235
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:27,849
and gives you a grandson,

236
00:13:27,891 --> 00:13:30,630
that would at least carry on
the Lu family line.

237
00:13:31,750 --> 00:13:32,790
What did you just say?

238
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,440
He said that if Ms. Lu marries soon

239
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:37,600
and gives you a grandson,

240
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:39,609
that'll carry on the Lu family line.

241
00:13:39,651 --> 00:13:40,339
Not that part.

242
00:13:40,381 --> 00:13:41,080
The one before.

243
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,030
The line before?

244
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:44,749
Dr. Hu gave Ms. Lu
a routine pulse check.

245
00:13:44,791 --> 00:13:46,240
Not that.

246
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:48,200
Ms. Lu is very likely to conceive.

247
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,080
Right.

248
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:11,250
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

249
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:16,639
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

250
00:14:16,681 --> 00:14:19,310
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

251
00:14:20,810 --> 00:14:22,369
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

252
00:14:22,411 --> 00:14:26,510
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

253
00:14:27,050 --> 00:14:32,460
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

254
00:14:34,050 --> 00:14:37,369
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

255
00:14:37,411 --> 00:14:40,719
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

256
00:14:40,761 --> 00:14:43,279
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

257
00:14:43,321 --> 00:14:46,300
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

258
00:14:46,570 --> 00:14:52,820
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

259
00:14:53,310 --> 00:14:56,619
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

260
00:14:56,661 --> 00:14:59,849
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

261
00:14:59,891 --> 00:15:06,619
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

262
00:15:06,661 --> 00:15:09,869
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

263
00:15:09,911 --> 00:15:13,309
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

264
00:15:13,351 --> 00:15:15,470
♪Boundless♪
